{$name}: W-weenie!? Are you a grandpa!?
Bellemere: Oh, look who's talking, “eight p.m!”
On that immature note, Bellemere leaves you with a playful, mocking expression, and you feel a small ping of regret… Did you just pass up a rare opportunity to spend time one-on-one with the hot redheaded gunner?
