title: date_bellemere_3_YesStart
location: docks
---

Bellemere: Alright! You’re buying!
It is not framed as a question, and you cringe momentarily. 
{$name}: Uh…
She elbows you, grinning.
Bellemere: Relax, I’m just kidding! If I was going to rob you, I’ll just cheat at gambling or something. Let’s go get wasted! 
The two of you head towards the bar in town. It’s still an hour or so until sunset, but you figure… for an off-duty Marine, it’s never too early, right? //LOCATION CHANGE
{$name}: You think anyone else will be there?
It was a common hang-out for their workmates, after all, though usually the little bar doesn’t really start popping until later. There weren’t a whole lot of options to relax on the small military installation, so the off-hours Marines tended to descend into the small town.
Bellemere: Hmm.. maybe? At least, we might see some of the officers that aren’t high-strung. Tashigi’s been more easy-going lately… maybe next time we can drag her out, too?
You doubt it. Still, it’s nice to note the two are not at each other's throats so much anymore.
The bar is small but clean, and the two of you opt for a table in the corner, calling your order across the mostly-empty room.
-> Just a beer for me, thanks!
