title: date_bellemere_3_b1p2
location: bar
---

Shot after shot goes down, the burning eventually smoothing out. It gets worryingly easy after a while, though the room is spinning a bit.
You feel far more woozy than your companion, but neither of you are willing to give up. You have something to prove, here, and Bellemere is just always stubborn.
You fall off your chair, first. You’re pretty sure you don’t actually pass out, but the ground is so comfy… It's very hard to get up again. Despite her own inebriated state, Bellemere manages to support you and half-drag you safely home.
She certainly doesn’t let you live it down; Bellemere is the clear “winner” of the competition!
Bellemere: You better remember the day I drank you literally under the table, {$name}! 
{$name}: Ugh…
Bellemere: Next time try a more tame challenge… like checkers, or-
{$name}: I get it! Please talk… softer…
Considering the hangover you both suffer from, is there even a “winner?” Well, at least it’s a story good for a laugh.
<<jump date_bellemere_3_dateEnd>> <<declare $bd3_points += 1>>
