title: date_bellemere_3_cheat
location: bar
---

You cough, and the sound jars Bellemere just a bit… but she keeps hold of her dart.
Flashing you a cheeky grin she aims and releases it, hitting her mark and winning the game.
Bellemere: Oh, we thought we were real clever there, huh?
{$name}: Uh… maybe. 
Bellemere leans in real close to you; you can feel her breath on your cheek and she moves in to whisper in your ear, and the warmth spreads to color your cheeks.
Bellemere: Or maybe you’re just that desperate for a kiss?
Your heart is in your throat, your mind racing. Did you make a mistake? Offend her? You can’t tell from her tone if she’s angry, amused… or something else entirely.
{$name}: Er…
Bellemere grabs your face, keeping your eyes directed at her own, pressing hard enough on your cheeks that you know you’re making a fish-like expression.
Bellemere: Well, if you’re so into the idea…
Her face grows close, and you’re sure she’s about to do it. Kiss you. For real, you’ll finally get to grow that much closer to the beautiful badass Marine. You close your eyes, unable to take it; the anticipation is making you dizzy, the redhead moving at an agonizingly slow pace…
And then you feel a sudden wetness against your forehead, a smacking sound obvious as she throws your head back, laughing. Your eyes shoot open and you touch the spot, embarrassed.
Bellemere: Ha! As if I’d make it that easy for ya! 
You gulp, but manage to recover soon enough.
