title: date_bellemere_3_Uta
location: bar
---

You love Princess Uta’s music, so powerful and pop-y at the same time. She’s a worldwide sensation, so you figure it’s a good bet that Bellemere likes her too.
Bellemere: Hey, it’s Princess Uta! I don’t know how someone can always seem so kind and patient with the whole world watching… I’d eventually get caught picking my nose or bad mouthing someone on video den-den mushi. 
{$name}: You’re too real to be a pop princess, you mean?
Bellemere: Well… yeah, and also I can’t sing worth shit!
You laugh, holding out a hand for the Commodore, and she takes it eagerly. Before you can lead her to the dance floor she leaps forward, pulling you behind roughly and turning you in a full circle before dipping you dramatically in a sweeping motion.
The two of you dance- not *well*, but with a sudden enthusiasm brought on by good music and drinks.
You end the night exhausted from so much partying, both promising to do it again sometime. 
